{
    "title": "Ring of Words2: Cats Party",
    "description": "As one of the classic word puzzle games, Ring of Words provides a special word-finding gameplay among word search games for kids and adults! Discover all the correct words hidden within the scrambled letters in the delicately designed grid of kids games! Embark on an exciting adventure of word puzzle games! Scan the grid for cleverly hidden words, triumphantly pointing them out to conquer the fun challenge!\r\n\r\n\u25c6Fun Gameplay\u25c6\r\nConnect letters horizontally, vertically, diagonally, or \"in 2 strokes\" to find designated words. It not only practices your brain but also your word-searching ability! \r\n\r\n\u25c6Edutainment\u25c6\r\nWe have adjusted the levels to introduce more elements that are particularly appealing to kids games! Now, Ring of Words 2 is an educational and entertaining game, suitable for everyone to play, and genuinely without ads.\r\n\r\n\u25c6Daily Sign In\u25c6\r\nPuzzle Piece Bonus Awaits! Sign in daily for special rewards to cheer up your day. When all puzzle pieces are collected, players can use them to unlock a picturesque photo of a famous place. Come and enjoy word search games fun with your kids now!\r\n\r\n\u25c6Various Items\u25c6\r\nUse a rich variety of items to help you connect words correctly!\r\nBulb: your first letter friend, lighting the way to success in word search solver!\r\nFan: it removes non-answer letters of some words.\r\nRocket: Blast off with the sensational Rocket to reveal 3 first letter clues!\r\nSunny Doll: your new ray of light who circles solution words with a smile!\r\nMore items and interesting mechanisms are waiting for you!\r\n\r\n\u25c6Exquisite Skins\u25c6\r\nDozens of beautiful skins of cute kittens are at your choosing with numerous special landscapes which will greatly enrich your experience  as you search and connect words.\r\n\r\nRecommend this super fun Ring of Words 2 - Word Search Games to your friends who love word games and word search solver. It is a MUST-PLAY for lovers of word search solver and word puzzle games.\r\n\r\nPRIVACY POLICY\r\nWe are dedicated to maintaining a safe online environment that complies with all privacy laws and regulations. Please review our full Privacy Policy at https://sites.google.com/view/microera-privacypolicy-k for details.",
